245 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(ATC/AETC - "The mechanical design of the chamber's air circulation motor is constructed with a sturdy shaft connected by a flexible coupling. The inner shaft is made of SS 304 material and is connected to the blower drum, which features a double vacuum seal mechanism. The motor is positioned outside the chamber, and it drives the blower drum through the inner SS 304 shaft. This design ensures smooth and reliable operation while maintaining the integrity of the chamber's internal environment.\215)/Pg 15 0 R/K[1 2]>>
endobj

246 0 obj
