endobj

252 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(Compared to stainless steel heaters, inconel heaters exhibit superior resistance to oxidation, corrosion, and high-temperature degradation. They are engineered to deliver reliable and efficient heat transfer without direct radiation onto the test item, ensuring a uniform heating process that doesn't adversely affect the test specimen.)/Pg 15 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

